WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.065 --> 00:00:01.603
- Hi, I am Tiffani Thiessen

00:00:01.603 --> 00:00:04.787
and today I'm making my mom's
famous cream cheese pie.

00:00:04.787 --> 00:00:07.410
I love this cream cheese pie

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:10.400
one because it has cheese
in it and I'm a cheese lover

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.957
and two, because it was
something that my mom always made

00:00:12.957 --> 00:00:14.787
and it was something that brought memories

00:00:14.787 --> 00:00:16.013
every time I would have a bite.

00:00:16.013 --> 00:00:19.292
I remember literally growing
up having this cream cheese pie

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:21.367
at every special occasion and holiday.

00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:22.908
I don't remember exactly the first time

00:00:22.908 --> 00:00:25.535
I made this pie and it
was quite a long time ago

00:00:25.535 --> 00:00:27.511
and I do remember being
very nervous about it

00:00:27.511 --> 00:00:29.276
because it's a staple in our family

00:00:29.276 --> 00:00:31.261
and I wanted to make sure I did it right.

00:00:31.261 --> 00:00:32.724
What's unique about this recipe

00:00:32.724 --> 00:00:34.798
is that most people
think it's a cheesecake

00:00:34.798 --> 00:00:35.667
but it's actually not.

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.321
It's more of a cream cheese pie.

00:00:37.321 --> 00:00:39.973
So it has a little more of
the texture of an actual pie.

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:42.110
This cream cheese pie is something

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:45.399
that when I make it for somebody
who hasn't had it before,

00:00:45.399 --> 00:00:47.713
they wanna know why I
haven't had it before.

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:50.324
Everybody who makes it,
everybody who has it,

00:00:50.324 --> 00:00:51.966
it's something that gets requested

00:00:51.966 --> 00:00:53.233
over and over and over again

00:00:53.233 --> 00:00:55.003
and I think it's gonna
be the same for you guys.

00:00:55.003 --> 00:00:58.009
We usually make the cream
cheese pie for special occasions

00:00:58.009 --> 00:00:59.531
and mostly during the holidays

00:00:59.531 --> 00:01:02.687
but my daughter does request
it on her birthday as well.

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:04.588
My daughter and I cook a lot together.

00:01:04.588 --> 00:01:06.419
She's now seven and a half years old

00:01:06.419 --> 00:01:08.227
so she's getting pretty good at it.

00:01:08.227 --> 00:01:10.173
She actually has her own set of knives,

00:01:10.173 --> 00:01:12.614
kid knives of course but she's
getting really great at it.

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:13.960
She likes to be alongside me

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.015
and we are definitely making
memories in the kitchen.

00:01:16.015 --> 00:01:17.274
It's a special time right now.

00:01:17.274 --> 00:01:19.456
I started cooking as a young little girl

00:01:19.456 --> 00:01:21.398
kind of peering my head through the corner

00:01:21.398 --> 00:01:24.082
watching the other ladies in
my family cooking together

00:01:24.082 --> 00:01:25.501
and I wanted to be with them.

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:28.352
I think for me, being in
the kitchen and cooking,

00:01:28.352 --> 00:01:31.508
it's just another expression
of being artistic.

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:33.308
I also love trying new things

00:01:33.308 --> 00:01:37.051
and being able to be creative
and try new ingredients

00:01:37.051 --> 00:01:40.314
and try new techniques is
something that I love to do

00:01:40.314 --> 00:01:42.492
and I love also what food does.

00:01:42.492 --> 00:01:44.568
I love that food brings people together.

00:01:44.568 --> 00:01:46.167
It's a communal type thing

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:48.731
and whether it's your family,
your friends or whatever,

00:01:48.731 --> 00:01:50.959
I really love what food does.

00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:52.626
- [Narrator] Oh yes.

